              "value": "Runic Resistance"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, abjuration)\n\nTrigger: The maftet takes damage from a Strike or spell effect\n\nThe maftet's protective runic tattoos glow, granting them resistance 5 to one damage type dealt by the triggering attack. This resistance applies against the triggering effect and lasts for 1 minute or until the maftet uses this ability again, whichever comes first. If the triggering effect deals multiple damage types, the maftet chooses which type to resist."
